# Case File Auditor: "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast Case spells." (CR 609.4b, 601.2h). Bot1's Auditor takes a Case of the Crimson Pulse ({2}{R}) from the top six and
# Bot1, with six Mox Pearls and nothing but white mana, casts it: a Case spell is cast with mana of any color. On turn 3 the same white mana does not cast a Lightning Bolt ({R}): the permission is for
# Case spells only. On turn 2 Bot2, with three white mana and no Auditor of its own, cannot cast its own Case of the Crimson Pulse: the Auditor's permission is its controller's.

